Subject: [PATCH] ALSA: hda/realtek: Refactor and simplify Samsung Galaxy Book init
Date: Mon,  9 Sep 2024 21:30:00 +0200
Message-Id: <20240909193000.838815-1-josh@joshuagrisham.com>
